<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/reading-in-context> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "interpreting in context" .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/reading-in-context> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "literary and historical context" .
