<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/reading-in-context> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The basic interpretive habit of reading any verse within its surrounding passage, its book, the whole of Scripture and its original historical and cultural setting, so that it means what its author meant before we ask what it means for us." .
