<https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/the-exodus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "God's deliverance of the Israelites from slavery in Egypt under Moses — through the plagues, the first Passover and the crossing of the sea — which became Israel's defining story of salvation and which the New Testament uses to explain the death and resurrection of Jesus." .
